{"id": "EUVD-2026-105277", "enisaUuid": "0bdae16d-2fc0-379e-932c-f0e598efaf9a", "description": "A remote HTTP server can set a cookie that curl accepts and writes to a\nNetscape cookie jar but cannot reload. On the next invocation using the same\npath for `--cookie` and `--cookie-jar`, curl fails before connecting, then the\ncleanup procedure replaces the jar with an empty file, deleting cookies for\nunrelated domains.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T20:03:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T20:03:28", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-86412.json", "https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-86412.html", "https://hackerone.com/reports/3973201"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cfhr-3c9j-cfhw", "CVE-2026-86412"], "assigner": "curl", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2ec40699-5239-3b6b-b25e-44fda24f13f2", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.20.0 \u22648.20.0"}, {"id": "32394f22-12d6-33fd-9d74-df90a60b70d0", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.21.0 \u22648.21.0"}, {"id": "3e582b6d-edcb-3cb1-801a-bef30a6ff50c", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.19.0 \u22648.19.0"}, {"id": "4e45af51-5326-3840-95d3-821af4b7da4c", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.22.0 \u22648.22.0"}, {"id": "92377695-8cdd-36e7-8a3c-38823e337cc4", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.18.0 \u22648.18.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ba8e9659-c868-3995-8cdc-37ca334faec9", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}], "isExploited": false}